{"nodes": [{"id": "ui_prototype_index_viewer_prototype", "label": "Canary Maze Viewer Prototype", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "ui-prototype/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Single HTML file, two Google fonts, no framework or dependencies, implementing S1 against the UI spec's tokens. The ?state= parameter selects ideal, first-run, partial, error, verified or verify-failed."}, {"id": "ui_prototype_index_hardcoded_viewer_copy", "label": "Hardcoded Viewer Copy and Constants", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ui-prototype/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The prototype hardcodes the claim sentence, the scope paragraph, both access-log records, both context blocks, the row count (ROWS = 12) and the Merkle root (ROOT = '9c4e...'), and rewrites copy imperatively per state in firstRun(), partial() and errored(). Exactly the construction U-0001 identifies as the cause of three on-screen contradictions; AC-8 and the derived-copy lesson require these to come from export.json instead."}, {"id": "ui_prototype_index_marker_reveal_sequence", "label": "Marker Reveal Sequence", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "ui-prototype/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The signature interaction: revealMark scrolls each record so the shared secret is visible, then the marker lights in the mint record and 80ms later in the sighting record, and the arc draws using the path's real getTotalLength so the reveal is exact. Honours prefers-reduced-motion by landing both markers immediately."}, {"id": "ui_prototype_index_verify_bundle_simulation", "label": "Verify Bundle Simulation", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "ui-prototype/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Counts up to ROWS with a per-row delay, announces progress through an aria-live status region, then either hides the button and shows the pass strip ('rows checked, root, server not contacted') or shows the fail strip naming row 7 while leaving the records unchanged."}, {"id": "ui_prototype_index_demo_plumbing", "label": "Demo Plumbing (state param and reset/replay keys)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "ui-prototype/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "?state= selects the rendered state and alt+shift+R / alt+shift+P reset and replay, matched on e.code so the browser's own shortcuts are not shadowed."}], "edges": [{"source": "ui_prototype_index_viewer_prototype", "target": "ui_spec_s1_sighting_screen", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "ui-prototype/index.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ui_prototype_index_viewer_prototype", "target": "ui_spec_design_tokens", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "ui-prototype/index.html", "source_location": "style :root", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ui_prototype_index_viewer_prototype", "target": "ui_spec_record_pair", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "ui-prototype/index.html", "source_location": "section.records", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ui_prototype_index_viewer_prototype", "target": "ui_spec_sequence_figure", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "ui-prototype/index.html", "source_location": "svg.seq", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ui_prototype_index_viewer_prototype", "target": "ui_spec_claim_sentence", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "ui-prototype/index.html",